*=========================================================
* LNK304 Stable LTspice Model
* Convergent version for general buck converter simulation
* Pins:
* D  = Drain
* FB = Feedback
* S  = Source
*
* Features:
* - 66 kHz oscillator
* - ON/OFF feedback
* - Behavioral MOSFET
* - Convergent, no current-limit chatter
*=========================================================

.subckt LNK304 D FB S

*=========================================================
* Parameters
*=========================================================
.param TPER=15.15u       ; Switching period for 66 kHz
.param FBTH=1.65         ; Feedback trip threshold

*=========================================================
* Oscillator
*=========================================================
* Generates 50% duty cycle pulse at ~66 kHz
VCLK CLK 0 PULSE(
+ 0
+ 5
+ 0
+ 100n
+ 100n
+ {TPER/2}
+ {TPER})

*=========================================================
* Feedback control
*=========================================================
* FB comparator (cycle-skipping / ON-OFF regulation)
BFB ENFB 0 V=
+ 0.5*(1-tanh((V(FB,S)-FBTH)/0.05))

*=========================================================
* VSENSE for current (dummy node, can be used for measurement)
*=========================================================
VSENSE SW S 0

CSW SW S 10p

*=========================================================
* Current limit (disabled for stability)
*=========================================================
BILIM ENILIM 0 V=1
* Note: original current-limit can be added later with a latched method

*=========================================================
* Gate drive
*=========================================================
* MOSFET is ON if ENFB * ENILIM * oscillator is high
*BGATE GATE 0 V=
*+ 5*V(ENFB)*V(ENILIM)*
*+ if(mod(time,TPER)<TPER/2,1,0)

BGATE GATE 0 V=
+ 5*V(ENFB)*V(ENILIM)*u(V(CLK)-2.5)


*=========================================================
* MOSFET model
*=========================================================
SMAIN D SW GATE 0 SWMOD

.model SWMOD SW(
+ Ron=18
+ Roff=1e8
+ Vt=2
+ Vh=0.2)

*=========================================================
* Optional: internal capacitance / leakage (for convergence)
*=========================================================
CDS D S 25p
RLEAK D S 100Meg

*=========================================================
* Provide DC paths for internal nodes
*=========================================================
RCLK   CLK    0 100Meg
RFB    ENFB   0 100Meg
RLIM   ENILIM 0 100Meg
RGATE  GATE   0 100Meg

.ends LNK304
